# Which model provider this deployment chose. No secrets in it — keys live in
# .env — but it is a per-deployment choice, so it is not committed. Absent means
# the built-in defaults, which reproduce the configuration this project shipped
# before providers were configurable. See llm-providers.example.json.
llm-providers.json

# Planning specs, engineering notes and architecture write-ups. Kept locally,
# not shipped: they are working documents, not documentation for users. The
# setup guides users need live in setup-wiki-docs/.
docs/
